可用（`0/3 nodes are available`）。\n- **证据支撑**：\n  - `fact-a5d5eccd6312` (K8s State) 和 `fact-0a02f215376a` (K8s Event) 明确指出失败原因是 `didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`。\n  - 低资源请求 (`fact-7ab1758a6bb2`) 排除了资源不足。\n  - Logging/Tracing 缺失 (`not_applicable`) 符合 Pod 尚未被调度到任何节点、容器未启动的物理状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 56.7s\n├─ 问题定位: 22.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 21.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52: 21.5s (Evidence 13.6s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-bsq52**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 56.725, "metrics": {"run_id": "8dc47e8023234ccb", "mttr": {"value": "56.7s", "seconds": 56.729840993881226, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数